WEBVTT

00:02:58.937 --> 00:03:00.221
kurse me pas sheshohet

00:03:00.221 --> 00:03:01.532
nuk behet me mire.

00:03:01.532 --> 00:03:06.012
(Te qeshura)

00:03:06.012 --> 00:03:08.831
Pyetja e vetme qe mund ti beni vetes eshte qe

00:03:08.831 --> 00:03:14.066
a mund te jete kjo shume arrogante?

00:03:14.066 --> 00:03:15.807
Dhe nese eshte

00:03:15.807 --> 00:03:21.189
po ashtu duke e marrur parasysh edhe faktin qe ne kemi ardhur shume afer zhdukjes.

00:03:21.189 --> 00:03:24.556
Aty kishin mbetur rreth 2,000 te specieve tona.

00:03:24.556 --> 00:03:26.639
Disa jave me shume pa te reshura shiu,

00:03:26.639 --> 00:03:29.723
ne nuk do t'i kishim pare kurre keto.

00:03:29.723 --> 00:03:36.422
(Te qeshura)